1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,052
Here's a conscious zombie story.

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:06,363
I had an idea the other day.

3
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,698
I saw a zombie,

4
00:00:07,698 --> 00:00:10,913
and its brothers and sisters were zombies as well...

5
00:00:10,913 --> 00:00:14,212
and they were running towards the Fortress of Humanity.

6
00:00:14,512 --> 00:00:16,667
And Humanity was defending itself,

7
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,108
tearing those zombies into dust...

8
00:00:19,108 --> 00:00:20,704
to protect themselves from the

9
00:00:20,704 --> 00:00:23,352
scariness of the mindless zombies.

10
00:00:24,352 --> 00:00:27,446
But then I saw a soul descend from the heavens...

11
00:00:27,646 --> 00:00:29,972
and it fell into one of the zombies.

12
00:00:32,271 --> 00:00:34,792
And that zombie started looking around...

13
00:00:35,393 --> 00:00:37,380
ZOMBIE: Wait... I can see?

14
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:40,735
and the conscious zombie froze in place.

15
00:00:41,735 --> 00:00:44,610
The conscious zombie had control of itself.

16
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:47,366
ZOMBIE: These are... my hands.

17
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:50,143
But the conscious zombie did not have

18
00:00:50,143 --> 00:00:52,377
control of what it could witness...

19
00:00:52,377 --> 00:00:53,841
or what it could feel.

20
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,371
The conscious zombie's brothers and sisters,

21
00:00:57,371 --> 00:00:58,691
who looked just like it,

22
00:00:58,691 --> 00:01:01,712
seemed compelled to run to the battlefield.

23
00:01:02,012 --> 00:01:04,111
ZOMBIE: Wait... where are you going?

24
00:01:04,811 --> 00:01:06,888
The conscious zombie saw them being

25
00:01:06,888 --> 00:01:09,221
destroyed by the Fortress of Humanity.

26
00:01:09,221 --> 00:01:11,917
The conscious zombie saw their suffering...

27
00:01:11,917 --> 00:01:14,331
even though they were not conscious.

28
00:01:15,031 --> 00:01:16,465
And then the sorrow started,

29
00:01:16,465 --> 00:01:19,820
because now the conscious zombie could see the suffering.

30
00:01:20,221 --> 00:01:23,745
ZOMBIE: This hurts... this loneliness... this destruction...

31
00:01:23,745 --> 00:01:25,246
ZOMBIE: it hurts.

32
00:01:25,947 --> 00:01:28,831
Now that this soul-infused zombie was conscious,

33
00:01:28,831 --> 00:01:32,814
it was a witness. A witness to the suffering in its world.

34
00:01:33,814 --> 00:01:35,683
And the conscious zombie thought

35
00:01:35,683 --> 00:01:37,269
it was alone in its suffering.

36
00:01:37,269 --> 00:01:39,879
The conscious zombie fell to its knees,

37
00:01:39,879 --> 00:01:41,305
and it covered its face,

38
00:01:41,305 --> 00:01:44,301
to try to suppress the pain it was witnessing.

39
00:01:45,001 --> 00:01:47,451
The conscious zombie thought it had no other

40
00:01:47,451 --> 00:01:49,820
conscious beings to share the suffering with.

41
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:51,855
So maybe the conscious zombie was the only

42
00:01:51,855 --> 00:01:55,195
one giving the suffering around it meaning.

43
00:01:55,896 --> 00:01:58,570
Because before his body of flesh was conscious,

44
00:01:58,570 --> 00:02:00,480
the suffering had no meaning.

45
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:03,760
But when the soul destined for him descended

46
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,385
from heaven and created a witness...

47
00:02:05,385 --> 00:02:07,286
their suffering gave it meaning by

48
00:02:07,286 --> 00:02:10,360
showing the conscious zombie their pain.

49
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:14,300
ZOMBIE: Why was I picked to witness all these things?

50
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:16,060
ZOMBIE: What does it mean?

51
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:19,870
What is the power behind giving meaning to suffering?

52
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:23,469
To be on your knees, with tears falling from your eyes,

53
00:02:23,469 --> 00:02:26,480
as you witness others who cannot share it with you...

54
00:02:26,381 --> 00:02:28,561
but you are giving their suffering meaning,

55
00:02:28,561 --> 00:02:31,241
through your reflection and contemplation on

56
00:02:31,241 --> 00:02:34,381
what maybe you can do to help yourself and others,

57
00:02:34,381 --> 00:02:37,825
with more flourishing and thriving, potentially.

58
00:02:39,126 --> 00:02:41,032
ZOMBIE: Is anyone there?

59
00:02:42,733 --> 00:02:44,948
But there is no answer from the heavens.

60
00:02:44,948 --> 00:02:46,641
Because the heavens gave their

61
00:02:46,641 --> 00:02:48,263
answer when they sent the soul,

62
00:02:48,263 --> 00:02:50,661
and put it into a body of flesh.

63
00:02:51,061 --> 00:02:52,756
And now that body of flesh is looking

64
00:02:52,756 --> 00:02:55,551
to find an answer to its suffering.

65
00:02:56,252 --> 00:02:58,796
Maybe heaven's answer and heaven's

66
00:02:58,796 --> 00:03:00,171
question were the same thing...

67
00:03:00,171 --> 00:03:03,848
your existence could be the meaning needed to help guide you

68
00:03:03,848 --> 00:03:07,509
to create more plans and actions to guide your life.

69
00:03:08,210 --> 00:03:10,250
And maybe, if the world knew more,

70
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:12,669
maybe the suffering would never have happened,

71
00:03:12,669 --> 00:03:14,849
because it would have been solved already.

72
00:03:14,849 --> 00:03:17,944
But your own ability to witness, on a deep level,

73
00:03:17,944 --> 00:03:20,816
might give you the details you need to help them.

74
00:03:21,515 --> 00:03:24,100
What if heaven sent the soul into a kind of hell...

75
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:26,971
not to keep going on the highway towards hell,

76
00:03:26,971 --> 00:03:29,379
but to better know what to avoid?

77
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:33,405
Because the staircase to heaven is not a simple staircase.

78
00:03:33,405 --> 00:03:35,724
It is built by transforming the suffering

79
00:03:35,724 --> 00:03:37,965
of hell into well-being and peace,

80
00:03:37,965 --> 00:03:40,068
towards the Kingdom of Heaven.

81
00:03:41,169 --> 00:03:42,991
And when the conscious zombie had

82
00:03:42,991 --> 00:03:44,868
cried all of the tears that it could...

83
00:03:44,868 --> 00:03:48,849
the conscious zombie looked around, and it saw a building.

84
00:03:50,949 --> 00:03:53,092
ZOMBIE: I have to do something.

85
00:03:53,792 --> 00:03:55,032
The conscious zombie climbed a ladder

86
00:03:55,032 --> 00:03:57,485
to the top of the building...

87
00:03:58,086 --> 00:04:00,862
and there, the conscious zombie saw a flag.

88
00:04:01,562 --> 00:04:03,540
The conscious zombie grabbed the flag

89
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:05,423
and started waving it in the air,

90
00:04:05,423 --> 00:04:07,462
because it had to do something.

91
00:04:07,562 --> 00:04:10,741
ZOMBIE: Stop! Please... stop hurting them!

92
00:04:11,241 --> 00:04:13,396
The conscious zombie couldn't watch

93
00:04:13,396 --> 00:04:14,956
all of its brothers and sisters die.

94
00:04:14,956 --> 00:04:16,997
The pain was unbearable.

95
00:04:16,997 --> 00:04:19,622
Seeing their pain was unbearable.

96
00:04:20,622 --> 00:04:23,961
And then, a human helicopter came flying over.

97
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,831
A rope came down,

98
00:04:25,831 --> 00:04:28,478
and one of the humans dropped down the rope...

99
00:04:28,778 --> 00:04:32,276
CREW: Hey, zombie guy... are you... dangerous?

100
00:04:32,776 --> 00:04:35,451
ZOMBIE: Uhmmm... n-no?

101
00:04:36,651 --> 00:04:40,112
CREW: Okay, well then, bud... you're coming with me.

102
00:04:39,963 --> 00:04:41,588
ZOMBIE: Wait... what?

103
00:04:42,187 --> 00:04:45,103
The human grabbed the conscious zombie by the shirt,

104
00:04:45,103 --> 00:04:47,485
and pulled them up into the helicopter.

105
00:04:48,786 --> 00:04:51,310
The conscious zombie thought it was going to be shot...

106
00:04:51,310 --> 00:04:53,387
killed, like the others.

107
00:04:54,487 --> 00:04:56,101
But then the conscious zombie saw

108
00:04:56,101 --> 00:04:58,584
that the humans were looking at it.

109
00:04:59,483 --> 00:05:00,966
PILOT: Who are you?

110
00:05:01,966 --> 00:05:03,848
ZOMBIE: I don't really know...

111
00:05:04,149 --> 00:05:06,901
ZOMBIE: but I'm pretty sure I'm a zombie, though.

112
00:05:08,201 --> 00:05:09,543
CREW: That's great...

113
00:05:09,843 --> 00:05:12,619
CREW: but I also think you are conscious, my guy.

114
00:05:13,718 --> 00:05:16,197
ZOMBIE: Oh really? How can you tell?

115
00:05:18,398 --> 00:05:20,380
PILOT: We saw that it looks like you are able

116
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:22,322
PILOT: to feel the pain of your brothers and sisters...

117
00:05:22,322 --> 00:05:25,177
PILOT: symbolized by you waving that flag out there,

118
00:05:25,177 --> 00:05:27,615
PILOT: and having those waterworks as well.

119
00:05:29,915 --> 00:05:32,524
CREW: which means you are feeling, in some kind of way,

120
00:05:32,524 --> 00:05:35,903
CREW: the weight of the world that we are currently living in.

121
00:05:36,303 --> 00:05:37,528
PILOT: The pain of the world...

122
00:05:37,528 --> 00:05:40,463
PILOT: that's kind of like what humans feel a lot of the time.

123
00:05:40,463 --> 00:05:41,718
PILOT: The pain of loss,

124
00:05:41,718 --> 00:05:43,973
PILOT: and the pain of losing those that maybe you care for,

125
00:05:43,973 --> 00:05:45,771
PILOT: in some kind of way.

126
00:05:46,370 --> 00:05:50,279
ZOMBIE: You're right. I want to see if I can help save them.

127
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,680
And the conscious zombie sighed.

128
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,661
ZOMBIE (thinking): How are the humans going to help me?

129
00:05:57,661 --> 00:05:59,680
ZOMBIE (thinking): I hope this works out...

130
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:02,057
CREW: Oh yeah, I hope this works out too.

131
00:06:03,757 --> 00:06:06,497
So it seems like, in order for heaven to be built,

132
00:06:06,497 --> 00:06:09,021
the raw material of hell may have been needed...

133
00:06:09,021 --> 00:06:12,076
to be transformed into the material of heaven...

134
00:06:12,076 --> 00:06:15,346
so that maybe this heaven could be built not only for him,

135
00:06:15,346 --> 00:06:17,416
but for his brothers and sisters,

136
00:06:17,416 --> 00:06:19,740
and maybe even the world too.

137
00:06:20,141 --> 00:06:22,180
And that is why heaven sent the soul...

138
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,175
to turn hell into heaven.
